# Session UI

Colors from `crate::ui::theme`. Lengths through `crate::ui::dpi::px`. Call `dpi::enable` before any window.

- Rounded controls: `crate::ui::chrome::paint` (coverage AA). Never GDI `RoundRect`.
- Inputs: borderless `EDIT` in `FtrackerField`. Radius ~10px, `LINE` idle / `PRIMARY` focus. No `WS_EX_CLIENTEDGE`.
- Buttons: owner-draw, same AA radius, filled `PRIMARY` or outlined cancel.
- Enroll copy: admin scans the QR, then the 6-digit code. Never show bot token or admin chat id from `.env`.
